<title>LUXEMBOURG: SOCCER-LUXEMBOURG 0 RUSSIA 2 LATEST.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LUXEMBOURG 0 RUSSIA 2 LATEST.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia led Luxembourg 2-0 in</p>
<p>their World Cup European group five qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Andrei Tikhonov 35, Andrei Kanchelskis 39</p>
</text>
